      "sequence_position": 9,
      "problem": "Find the cofactor of ${x}_{32}$ in \n$X=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 6 & -2 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 3 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of ${x}_{32}$, we remove the $3$rd row and $2$nd column: \n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}0 & ∗ & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & ∗ & 2 & 0 \\\\ ∗ & 6 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ -6 & ∗ & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{32}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${x}_{32}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{32} & =(-1)^{3+2}{M}_{32} \\\\  & =-{M}_{32} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
